{"2854310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shenzhou Saga: Three Kingdoms", "steam_appid": 2854310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "“设使国家无有孤，不知当几人称帝，几人称王！”<br><br>首个推出的剧本「魏武挥鞭」：玩家将以曹操为第一视角，亲临那个充满战火和英雄豪情的时代。官网测试招募正在进行中，将于5月17日正式开启测试。<br><br>-<br><br>《代号南乡子：天下英雄谁敌手》是由快手旗下弹指宇宙自研的策略扮演游戏。<br><br>【游戏特色】<br><br>—波澜壮阔的英雄之旅—<br><br>你将亲身经历“曹操”一生起伏，大小战役。在十八路诸侯会盟、群雄逐鹿、官渡之战、赤壁之战等一系列重要历史事件时，你，将如何做出选择？<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854310/extras/afde6cc355c19aae842692501db183d1.poster.avif?t=1731481533\" width=614 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854310/extras/afde6cc355c19aae842692501db183d1.webm?t=1731481533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854310/extras/afde6cc355c19aae842692501db183d1.mp4?t=1731481533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>—源自中国传统的美学—<br><br>国画宣纸质感的场景，展祖国大好河山；工笔国漫风角色立绘，新派传统美；临场感十足的连环画剧情表演；诗词歌赋的书法之美，亦是三国。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854310/extras/2783118d0d372da221f2ad986b273c2c.poster.avif?t=1731481533\" width=614 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854310/extras/2783118d0d372da221f2ad986b273c2c.webm?t=1731481533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854310/extras/2783118d0d372da221f2ad986b273c2c.mp4?t=1731481533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>—万物万象的奇谋系统—<br><br>日月星辰，风云水火，皆可为谋。施猛火、引洪水、埋伏兵、设陷阱......决胜千里之外，弹指间扭转战场局势，一战定乾坤。 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854310/extras/185e4d499c9e08f9edd9ad26a648cb3b.poster.avif?t=1731481533\" width=614 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854310/extras/185e4d499c9e08f9edd9ad26a648cb3b.webm?t=1731481533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854310/extras/185e4d499c9e08f9edd9ad26a648cb3b.mp4?t=1731481533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>—以“棋”还原经典战役—<br><br>浅绛山水，运麾方寸之间。合击、单挑、卡位、撤退、地利......利用棋盘“走格子”，巧妙还原三国著名经典战役。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854310/extras/aff37f2140965065fad3320e85088e5d.poster.avif?t=1731481533\" width=614 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854310/extras/aff37f2140965065fad3320e85088e5d.webm?t=1731481533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854310/extras/aff37f2140965065fad3320e85088e5d.mp4?t=1731481533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>—千奇百怪的九州奇遇—<br><br>在剪纸风格的九州大地上，内置海量且诚意十足的剧情表演。你可以寻访名臣、揽胜解迷、甚至遭遇山贼，每一次的奇遇都可能触发一段意想不到而又符合人物生平的剧情故事。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854310/extras/a005e0706c60868153970938ed9efdb6.poster.avif?t=1731481533\" width=614 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854310/extras/a005e0706c60868153970938ed9efdb6.webm?t=1731481533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854310/extras/a005e0706c60868153970938ed9efdb6.mp4?t=1731481533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "“设使国家无有孤，不知当几人称帝，几人称王！”<br><br>首个推出的剧本「魏武挥